e_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage when attacking <a href=\"/wiki/Fiends\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fiends\">Fiends</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a>. </dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Devotee_of_Mahkloompah\"> Creature: Devotee of Mahkloompah </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devotee_of_Mahkloompah\" title=\"Devotee of Mahkloompah\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Devotee_of_Mahkloompah.png/120px-Portrait_Devotee_of_Mahkloompah.png.webp, /w/images/c/c4/Portrait_Devotee_of_Mahkloompah.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Portrait_Devotee_of_Mahkloompah.png/120px-Portrait_Devotee_of_Mahkloompah.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Portrait_Devotee_of_Mahkloompah.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devotee_of_Mahkloompah\" title=\"Devotee of Mahkloompah\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.p