/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>48</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>15</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<p>Summons 4x Proselyte of Mahkloompahs, wielding <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Arms\" title=\"BOOOAL's Arms\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Kuotoa_Javelin_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL%27s_Arms\" title=\"BOOOAL's Arms\">BOOOAL's Arms</a>.\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/40px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/60px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/80px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/40px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\">Gather Your Allies (class action)</a></span>\n</p><p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Only available during the <a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Confront the Elder Brain</a> quest if the player character kills <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/25px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/38px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/50px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"BOOOAL\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png/25px-Portrait_BOOOAL.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Portrait_BOOOAL.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/BOOOAL\" title=\"BOOOAL\">BOOOAL</a> and is named their new god, Mahkloompah, in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041728\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.154 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.166 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6131/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 165838/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 69680/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 37/1000\nLua time usage: 0.035/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1651389/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n164.16%  214.918     58 Template:Trim\n100.00%  130.920      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%  130.920      1 -total\n 33.19%   43.454      6 Template:Spell_action\n 21.10%   27.623      3 Template:Creature\n 14.50%   18.981      3 Template:Creature/format\n 14.09%   18.446      6 Template:Spell_action/format\n 13.84%   18.121      3 Template:AttributeBlock\n 13.59%   17.789     12 Template:Icon_text\n  9.78%   12.798      6 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:45166-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715041728 and revisio